# scripts/ci-parity-paths: which workflow files hold the jobs check-ci-parity.sh compares, per
# platform, and the ones deliberately out of scope. Every workflow file in either directory must
# appear here, listed or ignored, or the check fails. See internal-tooling harness/check-ci-parity.sh.
